# Grace Lee Portfolio — Cursor Rules
# Drop this file at portfolio/.cursorrules

## Stack
Static HTML/CSS/JS. No frameworks. No build step. All files live flat in portfolio/.
Images: portfolio/images/  — always src="images/filename.ext"
Files:  portfolio/files/   — always href="files/filename.pdf"
Fonts: Instrument Serif + DM Sans from Google Fonts (always include the <link> in <head>)

