## Case Study Page Layout

All case study sections use a two-column grid: 420px label | 1fr content.

```css
.section { padding: 80px 60px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 420px 1fr; gap: 60px; }
.section-label { font-size: 0.72rem; letter-spacing: 0.16em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted); padding-top: 6px; }
.section-content h2 { font-family: 'Instrument Serif', serif; font-size: 1.9rem; font-weight: 400; color: var(--black); margin-bottom: 20px; }
```

Hero uses the same grid with padding: 100px 60px 80px and h1 at clamp(2.8rem, 5vw, 4.2rem).

Divider between sections: <div class="divider"></div>
```css
.divider { height: 1px; background: var(--rule); margin: 0 60px; }
```

Image break: <div class="img-break"><img src="images/x.png" /></div>
```css
.img-break { padding: 0 60px; }
.img-break img { width: 100%; display: block; border-radius: 8px; }
```

