```
bg: #FF5500, padding: 56px 60px. Text is white Instrument Serif italic, clamp(1.4rem, 2.5vw, 2rem).

### Three-column grid (pillars/insights)
```html
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:1px;background:var(--rule);border:1px solid var(--rule);margin-top:32px;">
  <div style="background:var(--off-white);padding:32px 28px;">
    <p style="font-size:0.72rem;letter-spacing:0.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--accent);margin-bottom:14px;">Category</p>
    <p style="font-weight:500;color:var(--black);margin-bottom:10px;font-size:0.95rem;">Title</p>
    <p style="font-size:0.88rem;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6;">Body copy.</p>
  </div>
  <!-- repeat × 3 -->
</div>
```

### Scrollytelling — sticky image right, scrolling text left
Desktop: grid 420px | 1fr, left col has .SECTION-step divs (min-height:100vh), right col is position:sticky top:80px with absolutely stacked images toggled by opacity via IntersectionObserver scroll listener.
Mobile: flat stacked text+image pairs, display:none on desktop, display:flex on mobile.
Breakpoint to toggle: 860px.
JS: scroll listener checks rect.top < window.innerHeight * 0.55 to set active step index, then sets opacity 1/0 on images.

